Modifications in this repository include lazy NPU imports, a dataclass-safe
module loader, deterministic seeds, explicit tensor values, optional input
reset and correctness callbacks, actual binding metadata, and structured
worker errors. The surrounding CLI, orchestration and scanner are maintained
independently of the vLLM and vLLM-Ascend source checkouts.
